"""Explicit review dossiers for the release inventory.

Selections below are authored by contract scope. They are not keyword-based
achievement rules. A dossier records complete current assertion sources and
effective current package passes; callers must still reconcile each item's
meaning and any Go/reference difference. Missing tests remain a gate failure.
"""
